The [[weapon]]s included in the [[Community Expansion Pack]] (CEP) offer variety to players, but suffer from the same limitations as other non-[[BioWare]] weapons. These weapons cannot be chosen when selecting a weapon-specific [[feat]] (e.g. [[weapon focus]]), and the [[spell]]s that target weapons (e.g. [[magic weapon]]) need to be modified in order to recognize these new items as weapons (i.e. valid targets). Those latter spell modifications are available on the [http://nwvault.ign.com/View.php?view=Scripts.Detail&id=3503 NWN Vault].

